Participation Windows
A Participation Window is an open invitation connected to a question, responsibility field, tool or unresolved problem.
Each window may describe:
what is currently being investigated
what knowledge or expertise is needed
what proposals already exist
what perspectives are missing
how a person, institution or AI may contribute
and what the next stage of development could be
Participation may take the form of a criterion, critique, research source, experiment, precedent, model, scenario or an entirely different approach.
